er.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T20:02:35-07:00","id":935905,"title":"","content":"The FBI are the elite of law enforcement, so they tend to be less corruptable. The CIA, the DEA, the NSA, etc tend to be softer targets because each of those organizations are looking for people with more flexible definitions of ethics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T03:55:00-07:00","id":936014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/926730-pentex-and-munitions?p=935905#post935905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The FBI are the elite of law enforcement, so they tend to be less corruptable. The CIA, the DEA, the NSA, etc tend to be softer targets because each of those organizations are looking for people with more flexible definitions of ethics.</div> </div> </div> </div>So what are your thoughts on Hoover and Liddy?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T05:36:54-07:00","id":936040,"title":"","content":"Hoover was a political hack appointed to the wrong place, one whose influence took decades to erase. Liddy had already left the FBI to take a position at Nixon's campaign, so he was a former FBI agent when he did wrong. I am not saying that the FBI is perfect, I am just saying that they are the elite of law enforcement and are less corrupt than local law enforcement, state law enforcement agencies, or other federal law enforcement agencies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T18:20:41-07:00","id":936334,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/926730-pentex-and-munitions?p=935898#post935898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> First he was CIA not FBI.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, but Robert Phillip Hanssen <i>was</i>. A similar situation.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what are your thoughts on Hoover and Liddy?</div> </div> </div> </div>*LOL* Good one.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The FBI are the elite of law enforcement, so they tend to be less corruptable. The CIA, the DEA, the NSA, etc tend to be softer targets because each of those organizations are looking for people with more flexible definitions of ethics.</div> </div> </div> </div>And...<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hoover was a political hack appointed to the wrong place, one whose influence took decades to erase.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would agree with that to an extent, but I think these are more nuanced issues (although very much related). There is a significant difference between flexible morals, and one's dedication to a cause. I would say that while CIA, NSA, and (to a lesser extent) DEA, seek individuals with &quot;flexible morals&quot;, they also tend to draw True Believers -- and as such would NOT be soft targets for supernatural compulsion (like Geas). Hoover is a perfect example. The guy was clearly possessed of dubious morality, but he <i>had</i> a vision that he was very much driven to pursue. Hoover really (in a practical sense) <i>created</i> modern law enforcement, particularly with regard to investigation and forensics. Also, if he was little more than a &quot;political hack&quot; with poor morals, he would probably have ended up like Senator Joseph McCarthy -- not becoming one of the longest-serving bureaucrats in American history (he must have been doing<i> something </i>right). He wanted to make federal law enforcement a highly professional, centrally organized, and scientifically oriented organization. In many ways he took the precepts of Robert Peel and extended them to their logical conclusion. Anyway, I'd say that it would have taken quite a bit to make J.E. Hoover turn against the organization that he poured his heart and soul into for most of his adult life -- even if his political views were almost barbaric.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=